{"server":"tw","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_01_beg","groupId":"act43side","stageId":"act43side_01","title":"彩排日","storyCode":"AD-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5419646e3d2d9c723fbadd2bb64d06edad53f3c09999991b410d6afefc11180f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"老演員道爾頓的死被製片人格蕾塔強硬地判定為意外，製片統籌謝莉卻認定這與五年前的某件舊事有關。弄假成真的“殺人”讓盧西恩回憶起過去劇團長為年幼的自己上的一課。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g3_filmset"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老道爾頓的死，是個意外——這就是結論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療組已經收殮他的遺體，調度短駁運輸車送回藍卡塢主城，並向警方報備事故詳情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝莉也已經重新檢查了其他剩下的道具，排除了所有隱患。大家稍微休息一下，今天下午劇組就重啟拍攝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"膠卷可以更換，攝影機壞了還有備用的，但這是死了一個人啊，我們才剛剛擦乾地面的血跡，就要……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼道爾頓明明是去找道具，最後卻找到了一把開鋒的真刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是誰哄騙酒醉的演員自己去找遺失的道具？還是說，其實是有人故意把它塞到了道爾頓的手裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哄騙？故、故意塞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道爾頓除了愛喝酒容易誤事，和劇組的大家也沒什麼私仇，誰會這樣做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且那把刀的形制很普通，劇組的廚房、街上的商店，甚至我們自己的房間，到處都有差不多的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1845_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得只是有人無心跟道爾頓提了一下，他就自己……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，疑點很多，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你只能自己去問道爾頓了，“偵探”小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道大部分的人，包括我，仍沉浸在失去同伴的衝擊中，但現在有個最重要的問題擺在眼前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拍攝已臨近尾聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道藍卡塢專用於拍攝的移動地塊跟移動城市不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然同樣受到中心控制塔的管控，但部分調配權限會直接分享給劇組，我們就是受益於此才能將移動地塊開出藍卡塢主城區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"租賃合約到期之後，攝影棚會陸續關閉，地塊將自動返航。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，更多操作空間也等於更高的維護成本。根據我簽署的合約，如果要臨時延長租賃合約，就需要支付一大筆違約金——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而它會直接分攤到每一個人的薪資單上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為製片人，我需要衡量全體成員的得失，確保我們的劇組能夠正常運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為主角兼投資人，我也同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這位“偵探”小姐倒是提醒我了，有些責任確實需要追究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道具組長？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道具組長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管理道具，這是你的本職工作，很顯然，你有嚴重的過失。甚至，整個拍攝過程中，你手下的實習生都比你更早就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"道具組長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，格蕾塔女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"親愛的，抱歉沒有任何意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即日開除出組。趁我們的移動地塊還沒開出主城區多遠，你可以儘早物色新的工作……別再說什麼了，你應該清楚，我已經足夠仁慈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道具組接下來的工作……我希望交由莫伊拉負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你不願意，也可以選擇跟你的組長一起離開劇組，當然我相信你不會做那種愚蠢的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，斯蒂芬，你需要把握時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《杜邦夫人之死》的結局還差一口氣，這是我們的共識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照原計劃，你應該在上週交出那幾場戲的定稿。顯然，拍攝進度馬上就要追上你的修改速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要身兼導演工作，你知道我們這個劇組其實很令人操心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是沒有好的靈感？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的原創劇本，這是你最珍愛的故事，給它一個最好的結局吧，親愛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我最在意的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜邦夫人在經歷一連串的變故後，到底是被哪個洛克菲勒殺死？在什麼場景裡？以什麼姿勢？她死前說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這決定了這部電影的水準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼在戲裡好看地死，決定了我怎麼在藍卡塢漂亮地重生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把我全部的身家都投入這部戲了，兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……神會來找我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米蘭妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，文學評論裡有一種說法，說所謂的“靈感”，是指神明直接附身在作者身上，代替他寫下新生與死亡，毀滅與希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯蒂芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1835_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，請放心，我會完成這個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，散會，去做準備吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾塔女士！格蕾塔女士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有很重要的事要找你談——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝莉，我知道你要說什麼，但不是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得先去看看盧西恩，他才剛來劇組，第一次參與電影拍攝就經歷了這麼嚴重的意外……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得確保他不會落荒而逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，無論你聯想到了什麼……忘了它，你想多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我來負責整個道具組？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜你啊，莫麗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然道爾頓剛過世不久——願他安息，但我真的為你高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在藍卡塢的工作時間比你久多了，但到現在也還只是個畫布景的，晉升的機會真的很難得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為蒂比總是喜歡把自己的主張加入背景，所以你們美術組的組長不敢讓你負責更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我只是從開拓區來藍卡塢謀生的手工愛好者，真的能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾塔女士說你可以，你就可以！她的眼光一向很準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你的姐姐也會很高興的，你不是受到她的影響才來藍卡塢的嗎？快點告訴她你現在已經是獨當一面的道具組長啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等晚上再跟她通話吧。我不能辜負格蕾塔女士的信任，得把工作做好才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂比","speakerId":"avg_4191_tippi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦~不錯嘛，現在已經開始有組長的樣子了哦？說不定再過兩天連找你看恐怖片你都不會賞臉啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂比！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g1_setting_lobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，別在我眼前晃來晃去了，謝莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分鏡表確認了三次，設備檢查了五次。我向製片人女士發過毒誓，不會再弄丟一台攝影機了，可以別盯著我了嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你說……真的是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼？大聲一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說道爾頓的死真的是意外嗎？你就不覺得有什麼不對勁的地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關我什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙整天把自己泡在酒桶裡，這兩個月不知道害我晚下班幾次，現在終於安靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他五年前還不是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廢話，那時候他還在格蕾塔和斯蒂芬的片子裡擔任主角，正值事業巔峰，那個時候我們不是也在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是最不對勁的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開籌備會的時候，我在工作人員名單裡看到了很多眼熟的名字，實際見到你們的面孔之後更加害怕，就好像——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像真的回到了五年前，再一次目睹了那名小演員的死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得這兩起事故……很像嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡像了？一個是墜亡，一個是道具刀弄錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝莉，你又開始杞人憂天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很理智……哦……我全都搞清楚了！道爾頓不就是當時那起事故的主要責任人嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他遭到報應了……有人來找他了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫停！別再抓你的手臂也別再胡思亂想了。我早就跟你說過——多看醫生，遠離劇組！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿布納","speakerId":"avg_npc_1843_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是拍爛片謀生的普通人，沒人把我們當回事。謝莉？謝莉，我說的話你聽到了沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謝莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到了……我聽到了……有什麼要來了，要來找我們了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_RL_castlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你需要在腦海中構想下刀的位置和角度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"右腹下方是臟器的間隙，血管分布密集但不致命。你可以藉他人之血抒情，為之後的高潮段落埋下伏筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者將刀尖上移，刺穿胸腔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"脆弱的肺葉沒有任何抵抗能力，對方會慢慢溺死在自己的血和你慷慨激昂的獨白之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舉起你的匕首，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想想我們已經排演過的段落，你一直表現得很好，只差這最後一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刺下去！讓刀尖體會攪動內臟、割斷血管的觸感，讓它聆聽心跳的聲音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你害怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……平庸的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他並非膽怯，只是心有不解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"劇團長，他到現在還不願練習刺殺，握住匕首後就再沒說過話了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了，去準備明天的演出吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我來指導這個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“白英花”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您親自……我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，匕首重嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你知道，它的重量並不來自金屬和裝飾，而是源自你的心，對嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"頭髮遮住了男孩的眉眼，他沉默著點頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“白英花”未能料到你領悟得如此之快，你在等她解惑，而她做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我說，孩子……"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇團長握住了盧西恩的小手，他的微笑是溫柔的，手上的力道卻強硬，不容拒絕。\n盧西恩覺得自己僵硬的手指在慢慢放鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘掉“白英花”試圖教你的那些技巧，你不需要模仿某一種握刀姿勢或是刺殺方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有不染血的匕首、不被擊發的弩，握緊它們就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們不是道具，它們會教會你該渴望什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，讓它們牽引你的行動，別懷疑，哪怕它指向的對象是你沒有想過的人——親友、摯愛，甚至自己……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，此刻站在你面前的我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別猶豫，揮下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你，那我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在扮演什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已經遺忘了技巧，那角色和台詞也暫且忘記吧，它們只是戲劇的載體，而非戲劇本身。"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧西恩終於握緊了刀，劇團長放開了他的手，半跪在他身前，讓兩人保持差不多的高度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我們離得太近太近了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很怕傷害到我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連這種情緒也一併遺忘吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，你會沉浸，你會觸碰到戲劇的美。"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著劇團長，盧西恩萌生出強烈的疑惑——這是否是自己第一次見到他？\n他理解不了對方說的所有話，他甚至懷疑這個男性菲林其實並不存在。\n盧西恩可以確定的是，自己的心臟在跳動。\n沒錯，心跳不會作假，心跳會給他答案。\n他要以什麼方式去詢問？\n劇團長微笑著，他在無聲地鼓勵自己。\n答案顯而易見。\n盧西恩毫不猶豫地揮刀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感受到了嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧西恩的手在顫抖，一擊之後，他的力氣差點用盡，險些握不住刀柄。\n劇團長沒有移動分毫，甚至連表情都沒有變化。\n但盧西恩很確信刀刃劃開了對方的身體，他聽到了聲音……他感受到了本不屬於他的疼痛——強烈的、肆意的疼痛。\n來到劇團後，他一直沉默，但此刻，那疼痛讓他突然想要歌唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你的第一課，孩子——所有的故事最終都只會剩下某種情緒，或者……"},{"type":"narration","text":"劇團長停頓了一下，盧西恩投去追問的目光，於是他對上了那對金色的瞳孔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某段密不可分的關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1841_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是天生的演員，你應該成為我的學生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"劇團長 (C)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1829_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮好之後，來找我……盧西恩，我永遠不會成為你的阻礙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g10_dormitory"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"盧西恩低頭看向自己的雙手。\n手套上的血跡早已清洗乾淨，但他依然無法忘記從道爾頓手中奪過刀時的感覺。\n沉醉、忘我。\n正如他的師長第一次教他使用匕首時湧出的複雜感受。\n忘記純熟的刺殺技巧，僅用濃烈的情緒點燃自我，只剩下兩個靈魂彼此撕咬。\n將生命收束於亦真亦假的小刀，賜予對方完美的終局——\n死亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧西恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾塔女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的臉色有點差……你還好嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
